abstract: >-
  A controlled cloud-log evidence study comparing original and clarified
  instructions and inspecting unsupported assertions about withheld fields.
  The companion contains 996 categorical decision records and 306 exact
  Splunk-based input/output replays. It supports retained-response analysis,
  not a claim of fresh inference replication or operational defense efficacy.
  License identifiers apply to different components as mapped in LICENSING.md.
